{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type the Falling Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to type each word correctly before it reaches the bottom. The game progresses phase after phase, steadily increasing pressure with faster speeds, denser word patterns, and more complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/989ad5e4ee47f16558e8465ecde8d197.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/989ad5e4ee47f16558e8465ecde8d197.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/989ad5e4ee47f16558e8465ecde8d197.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every phase, you receive <strong>+1 random\u00a0</strong>Power-up that can help you regain control when the screen becomes overwhelming. They can destroy words, freeze falling words in place, or push them back upward to buy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/34d9dbe9a48a86ff96aa1da969d12a28.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/34d9dbe9a48a86ff96aa1da969d12a28.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/34d9dbe9a48a86ff96aa1da969d12a28.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Falling Word Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, new mechanics are introduced to increase difficulty and force adaptation, Stone and diamond words add an extra layer, requiring you to type an additional word before they can be destroyed. Chained words force you to type the same word multiple times to fully break them. Bubble words float upward instead of falling and cannot be affected by power-ups. Bonus words never disappear, and the more you type them, the higher your score multiplier becomes in Survival modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/2dff15b2988c922a7ff43a10df10deae.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/2dff15b2988c922a7ff43a10df10deae.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/2dff15b2988c922a7ff43a10df10deae.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >15 Unique Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Ninja features <strong>15 unique bosses</strong>, each with distinct behavior and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights are divided into attack and defense phases. During attack phases, the boss applies pressure and unique effects. During defense phases, the boss becomes vulnerable and can only be damaged during this window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/a9cca15d3d0ca74c3e9da37e606712a3.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/a9cca15d3d0ca74c3e9da37e606712a3.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/a9cca15d3d0ca74c3e9da37e606712a3.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2862700?t=1770665294","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2862700?t=1770665294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/71f7c94b70a45ace5445058b4d3dadb5a5eb2ec1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770665294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/71f7c94b70a45ace5445058b4d3dadb5a5eb2ec1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770665294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type the Falling Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to type each word correctly before it reaches the bottom. The game progresses phase after phase, steadily increasing pressure with faster speeds, denser word patterns, and more complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/989ad5e4ee47f16558e8465ecde8d197.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/989ad5e4ee47f16558e8465ecde8d197.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/989ad5e4ee47f16558e8465ecde8d197.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every phase, you receive <strong>+1 random\u00a0</strong>Power-up that can help you regain control when the screen becomes overwhelming. They can destroy words, freeze falling words in place, or push them back upward to buy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/34d9dbe9a48a86ff96aa1da969d12a28.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/34d9dbe9a48a86ff96aa1da969d12a28.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/34d9dbe9a48a86ff96aa1da969d12a28.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Falling Word Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, new mechanics are introduced to increase difficulty and force adaptation, Stone and diamond words add an extra layer, requiring you to type an additional word before they can be destroyed. Chained words force you to type the same word multiple times to fully break them. Bubble words float upward instead of falling and cannot be affected by power-ups. Bonus words never disappear, and the more you type them, the higher your score multiplier becomes in Survival modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/2dff15b2988c922a7ff43a10df10deae.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/2dff15b2988c922a7ff43a10df10deae.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/2dff15b2988c922a7ff43a10df10deae.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >15 Unique Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Ninja features <strong>15 unique bosses</strong>, each with distinct behavior and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights are divided into attack and defense phases. During attack phases, the boss applies pressure and unique effects. During defense phases, the boss becomes vulnerable and can only be damaged during this window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/a9cca15d3d0ca74c3e9da37e606712a3.poster.avif?t=1770665294\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/a9cca15d3d0ca74c3e9da37e606712a3.webm?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/a9cca15d3d0ca74c3e9da37e606712a3.mp4?t=1770665294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Brain Boost Ninja"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/a7aa8670b548fe15f2ddf9cc96724f5fb8d0c6cb/header.jpg?t=1770665294","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2862700/955327711/e613ea2f222273aa11d42a2b1769cbe767e5ba2f/1766186635/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766188516","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2862700/955327711/